{"id":"53ae7f63203f2960","group":"28","path":"28/28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment.md","title":"噪声长码测试的三次傅里叶矩","display":"lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment — 噪声长码测试的三次傅里叶矩","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment","aliases":["28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment"],"display":"lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment — 噪声长码测试的三次傅里叶矩","depends_on":["[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]","[[28-df-fourier-transform]]"],"source_book_location":"Lemma 22.24","source_printed_pages":"480–481","source_pdf_pages":"506–507","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment — 噪声长码测试的三次傅里叶矩"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a628124170578d91\" href=\"?note=a628124170578d91\" title=\"28-df-noisy-long-code-test\">28-df-noisy-long-code-test</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcbf14393ebfa830\" href=\"?note=fcbf14393ebfa830\" title=\"28-df-fourier-transform\">28-df-fourier-transform</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma 22.24"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"480–481"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"506–507"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,\\rho,W,\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho\">\\(f,\\rho,W,\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a628124170578d91\" href=\"?note=a628124170578d91\" title=\"28-df-noisy-long-code-test\">28-df-noisy-long-code-test</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat f(S),\\chi_S\">\\(\\widehat f(S),\\chi_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fcbf14393ebfa830\" href=\"?note=fcbf14393ebfa830\" title=\"28-df-fourier-transform\">28-df-fourier-transform</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[W]\">\\(S\\subseteq[W]\\)</span>。有限整数幂采用空积约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^0=1\">\\(a^0=1\\)</span>（包括 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=0\">\\(a=0\\)</span>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"2\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho(f)-1=\\sum_{S\\subseteq[W]}\\widehat f(S)^3(1-2\\rho)^{|S|}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[2\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho(f)-1=\\sum_{S\\subseteq[W]}\\widehat f(S)^3(1-2\\rho)^{|S|}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明：把三次符号相关性 E[f(x)f(y)f(xyz)] 展开为字符和；独立均匀 x,y 的正交性要求三个字符索引完全相同，留下 fhat(S)^3 E[χ_S(z)]。噪声坐标独立且均值 1−2ρ，所以该期望为 (1−2ρ)<sup>{|S|}。空集因子为一，0</sup>0 按空乘积解释为一。已逐项复核原书计算。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Lemma 22.24；印刷页 480–481；PDF 页 506–507。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-noisy-long-code-test","status":"resolved","id":"a628124170578d91","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-fourier-transform","status":"resolved","id":"fcbf14393ebfa830","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-fourier-transform]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-noisy-long-code-test","status":"resolved","id":"a628124170578d91","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,\\rho,W,\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho$ 采用 [[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]；$\\widehat f(S),\\chi_S$ 见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]；$S\\subseteq[W]$。有限整数幂采用空积约定 $a^0=1$（包括 $a=0$）。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-fourier-transform","status":"resolved","id":"fcbf14393ebfa830","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f,\\rho,W,\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho$ 采用 [[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]；$\\widehat f(S),\\chi_S$ 见 [[28-df-fourier-transform]]；$S\\subseteq[W]$。有限整数幂采用空积约定 $a^0=1$（包括 $a=0$）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f,\\rho,W,\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat f(S),\\chi_S","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[W]","display":false},{"tex":"a^0=1","display":false},{"tex":"a=0","display":false},{"tex":"2\\operatorname{LCAcc}_\\rho(f)-1=\\sum_{S\\subseteq[W]}\\widehat f(S)^3(1-2\\rho)^{|S|}.","display":true}],"bytes":1555,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-407","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment]]、[[28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget]]、[[28-thm-hastad-thre